_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"1. What is the Athena Pro Spirit Edition Gaming Chair?","content":"<p>This is Blacklyte’s official gaming chair created in collaboration with Team Spirit, designed for esports training, long gaming sessions, and fans of the organization. It combines premium ergonomic support with Team Spirit branding and style.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_ABA7xH":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"2. What ergonomic features does the Spirit Edition include?","content":"<p>It features 4-way dynamic lumbar support, 4D adjustable armrests, a magnetic neck pillow, up to 149° recline with rocking, and Class-4 height adjustment—designed to keep you supported and comfortable during long gaming sessions.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_yNUQe3":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"3. What size and weight does the Spirit Edition support?","content":"<p>This limited-edition gaming chair is recommended for users up to 330 lbs (150kg) and up to 6’2″ (190cm) tall, fitting most body types comfortably.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_GMpgWG":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"4. Can I use this chair for work as well as gaming?","content":"<p>Absolutely. Its ergonomic adjustability makes it one of the best gaming chair for posture and a great choice for office work, streaming, schoolwork, and daily computer use, in addition to competitive play.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_anhkxR":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"5. Is assembly required, and how long does it take?","content":"<p>Yes, basic assembly is required. The package includes all necessary tools and instructions, and most users can assemble it within about 15–30 minutes.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_qMEfjp":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"6. Does the chair come with a warranty?","content":"<p>The Athena Pro Spirit Edition Gaming Chair comes with a 3-year gaming chair warranty as standard. By joining the <a href=\"\/pages\/warranty-extension\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Warranty Extension\">Extend Warranty Program<\/a>, coverage can be extended up to 5 years for added long-term protection.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}}},"block_order":["content_bAFTF7","content_ABA7xH","content_yNUQe3","content_GMpgWG","content_anhkxR","content_qMEfjp"],"custom_css":[".faqs-item {border-top: 1px solid #e6e6e6; font-family: Roboto;}",".collapsible-grid__item {border-bottom: 1px solid #e6e6e6;}",".collapsible-content {width: 100%; padding: 0 18.75vw;}",".halo-block-header {padding: 0 18.75vw;}",".halo-block-header h3 {font-family: Roboto; font-weight: 700;}",".card-body {color: #646669; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400;}","@media screen and (max-width: 768px) {.collapsible-content {padding: 0 5.33vw; } .halo-block-header {padding: 0 5.33vw; }}"],"settings":{"id_section":"faq","container":"fullwidth","padding_full_width":50,"mg_top_desktop":100,"mg_top_tablet":50,"mg_top_mobile":40,"mg_bottom_desktop":100,"mg_bottom_tablet":50,"mg_bottom_mobile":40,"collapsible_bg":"#ffffff","collapsible_bg_gradient":"","collapsible_title":"FAQ","color_title":"#000000","fontsize_title":32,"fontsize_title_mb":24,"collapsible_des":"","color_des":"#3c3c3c","fontsize_des":16,"fontsize_des_mb":12,"max_width_des":700,"title_align":"left","enable_image_right":false,"bg_content_color":"#ffffff","title_color":"#000000","content_color":"#000000","icon_color":"#000000","border_color":"#000000","font-size_heading":16,"font-size_content":16,"font-size_content_line-height":22,"font-size_heading_mb":12,"font-size_content_mb":12,"font-size_content_line-height_mb":18}},"1743652201516533c4":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"judge_me_reviews_review